- id: request-property-became-required-with-default
  text: the request property `created` with a default value became required
  comment: A request that omits this required property is invalid under the new contract, even though the property has a default. The default is a server-side fallback, it does not make the omitted property valid. Downgrade this check with --severity-levels if omitting the property is safe for your clients.
